{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>If</b> — Now the men of Gilead were nothing before the prophets." "<b>But vanity were they</b> — after [them]." "<b>In Gilgal they sacrifice bulls</b> — to Baal." "<b>Like heaps</b> — by way of parable, that they were many and visible."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:02.747932971Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}